url: "https://github.com/amachino/haldane-gap-refinement"
abstract: >-
  An unreviewed technical note autonomously researched and authored by GPT-6 Astra Max,
  with an exact rational certificate for a conditional periodic spin-one gap bound
  of 0.108 at every integer length at least 32. A sector-resolved recurrence,
  simultaneous moment inequalities, sharper existing thermal enclosures, and a new
  88-site integer trial calculation give the improvement. Smaller bounds cover
  shorter chains, including 0.07 at all integer lengths at least 24. The main
  certificate has 237 named checks, 51 individually checked lengths, ten finite
  intervals, and one infinite tail. Three supplemental cyclic traces are certified
  but unused in the main theorem. Earlier proofs are retained. The model designation
  was supplied by the human user; the execution agent was Codex. A backend model
  snapshot identifier was unavailable. No priority or independent upstream proof is claimed.
